problem: Add full iCloud remote CLI support without bundling Dropbox or fuse work
approach: Added dedicated remote icloud create/open commands, wired dispatch/CLI parsing, implemented iCloud provider-config helpers and temp-dir create/open tests, and updated README command docs
failed_paths:
  - Minified cli.rs and README.md made block edits unreliable, so I rewrote those files directly before rerunning formatter/tests
verification:
  - cargo fmt --all
  - cargo test -q
  - cargo clippy -- -D warnings
  - cargo run --quiet -- remote icloud --help
  - git diff --check
workflow_learning: When generated or minified source blocks resist exact-match edits, rewrite the full file deterministically and immediately re-run rustfmt plus parser tests
related_files:
  - README.md
  - src/cli.rs
  - src/commands/icloud.rs
  - src/commands/mod.rs
  - src/dispatch.rs
